<title>USA: Royal Appliance to buy back 5 pct of stock.</title>
<headline>Royal Appliance to buy back 5 pct of stock.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Royal Appliance Mfg. Co said Thursday it plans to buy back up to five percent of its common shares in open market or negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>The company has about 24 million shares outstanding, it said.</p>
<p>The share repurchase program is expected to end March 1, 1998, Royal Appliance said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
